	(text "PA15/pad19 high = status on. Shared with J2.\nTurn off for power traces; remove R52 to free pin.\n\nTarget power LED uses the switched supply BEFORE\nthe shunt. Its current is excluded from the trace.\nIt does not measure the instantaneous glitched VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
