	(text "Unpopulated plated holes; no connector in assembly BOM.\nPA15 also drives D7 via R52. PA0/PA1 are open-drain.\nGPIOs share target power; avoid external drive when off.\nUse VDD as a reference; external loads enter the trace."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
